#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:3
#: c5cdd699e1984b379841394cc9956fb1
msgid "条件替换（Conditional Replace）"
msgstr "Conditional Replace"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:5
#: 053e26f74b5942f1a9188cc620e9ce5e
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `ConditionalReplaceCard`"
msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `ConditionalReplaceCard`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:7
#: b764b3c9ce714053a7d48bce76ca8b57
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:9
#: 8ba85f32a52940dc99ccb8458124bdf4
msgid ""
"按空间坐标条件对指定元素做区域选择性替换。用 x/y/z 坐标表达式（如 `z>=8 and "
"z<=10`）筛选候选位点，只替换命中区域内的原子，未命中区域保持原样。适合表面钝化、界面修饰、层状材料选择性改性等场景。"
msgstr ""
"Replace a selected element only where a spatial-coordinate condition is "
"true. Expressions such as `z>=8 and z<=10` select candidate sites; atoms "
"outside the region remain unchanged. Use this for surface passivation, "
"interface modification, or layer-selective chemistry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:11
#: 8ae62e16142d464e8053353bd4a45549
msgid ""
"与 `Random Doping` 的区别：`Random Doping` 对全体 target 原子做无差别随机替换；`Conditional "
"Replace` 先用坐标条件筛选位点，再在命中区域内做替换。"
msgstr ""
"Unlike `Random Doping`, which samples all target atoms globally, "
"`Conditional Replace` first restricts sites with a coordinate expression and"
" replaces only within that region."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:13
#: f9ac7ccba9314b3db1d33b21c93a70f8
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:15
#: 70db1cda72c149b18314507bcce6342e
msgid "场景：模型在表面化学上完全失效，但体相预测很好"
msgstr "Scenario: Good bulk predictions but failed surface chemistry"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:17
#: 849685e34e344885933a08d793dcd30b
msgid ""
"你在 MgO 表面上训练了一个 NEP "
"模型，训练数据覆盖了完美晶体和表面弛豫结构。体相弹性常数和声子谱都很好，但一跑有表面吸附或表面钝化的结构，模型就崩了——能量误差是体相的 10 "
"倍。诊断结果是：训练集里所有 O 原子都处于体相八面体配位环境，模型从未见过低配位表面 O 的局域环境，更不知道表面 O 被 F 替换后会发生什么。"
msgstr ""
"An MgO NEP covers perfect crystals and relaxed clean surfaces and reproduces"
" bulk elasticity and phonons, but its error rises tenfold for adsorbed or "
"passivated surfaces. All training O atoms occupy bulk-like octahedral "
"environments; low-coordination surface O and F-substituted surface sites are"
" missing."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:19
#: 9a29e5c9579146fb907886a0181b3e6d
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 表面原子的化学环境与体相完全不同——配位数低、悬挂键多、更活泼。如果训练集缺少表面区域的元素变化（如 F 钝化表面 "
"O），模型会对表面化学完全盲猜。解决办法是用条件替换把表面几层的特定元素换成钝化元素，让模型学习表面化学环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Surface chemistry differs from the bulk through lower "
"coordination and dangling bonds. Create region-specific substitutions, such "
"as replacing O with F in the outer layers, so subsequent DFT labels teach "
"the model those environments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:21
#: 7aa21d77d0fe40f190236cc91137c419
msgid "**输入：** 一个 MgO 表面 slab 结构，z 方向 0-16 Å，表面 O 位于高 z 区域"
msgstr "**Input:** An MgO slab spanning z = 0-16 Å with surface O at high z."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:23
#: a22c87a4ede24a36bad75db21293a0a3
msgid "**目标：** 把顶层 2 Å 区域内的 O 替换为 F，模拟表面氟化"
msgstr "**Objective:** Replace O with F in the top 2 Å to model surface fluorination."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:25
#: c806bff00b324473b824ffaf3dc9b289
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:26
#: 7ebb4b6b4fea44b1b8c713da384520ca
msgid "`target` = `O`"
msgstr "`target` = `O`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:27
#: 1ce0bc7b4cbd48efa9e2a35732542b37
msgid "`replacements` = `F:1.0`"
msgstr "`replacements` = `F:1.0`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:28
#: 2a5cb2559db24dd6a0594e751585d70e
msgid "`condition` = `z>=8 and z<=10`"
msgstr "`condition` = `z>=8 and z<=10`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:29
#: b957057f9bf34805ae6692e6f79f78fd
msgid "`mode` = `1` （Exact 模式，确保全部命中位点被替换）"
msgstr "`mode` = `1` (Exact mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:31
#: a2cdd33e9d8a45ca977db6958d007c29
msgid "**输出：** 1 个结构，满足 z 在 8-10 Å 的所有 O 被替换为 F，其余区域不变。带 `Repl(O->F)` 标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** One structure in which all matching O at z = 8-10 Å become F, "
"with all other regions unchanged and label `Repl(O->F)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:33
#: 680a69e6d7d1423b83e3d983c82c7ce6
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:34
#: 76677716e45e4f0891d8ea7c1fbaff9f
msgid "重训后跑表面吸附测试，力的 MAE 应该显著降低，不再在表面区域出现异常大力误差"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, surface-adsorption force MAE should decrease "
"and extreme errors should no longer concentrate at the surface."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:35
#: 3bbf71a9f57b4b35a7d417aec043f45a
msgid "抽查输出，确认只有表面区域被替换，体相原子保持不变——如果体相也被动了，condition 表达式有问题"
msgstr ""
"Inspect output coordinates and confirm that only the surface region changed."
" Bulk substitutions indicate an incorrect condition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:36
#: 2e305a21c0ac4da08f315847ee87a489
msgid "如果需要多元素钝化，把 `replacements` 写成 `F:0.5,Cl:0.5`"
msgstr "For mixed passivation, use a recipe such as `F:0.5,Cl:0.5`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:37
#: 6d8904b5f07d4dd3a7f8cc1f609a81af
msgid "如果表面层厚度不确定，先用 `all` 条件验证替换配方正确性，再收紧 z 范围"
msgstr ""
"If the surface interval is uncertain, validate the replacement recipe with "
"`all`, then narrow the z condition after inspecting coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:39
#: 746b0b78b1ad437cbb45e6847a9e8b9c
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:41
#: abdb2045adce4963873ea719cb10d12b
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:42
#: 3a01750e7fe245a3a22e454281a0d39f
msgid "模型对表面/界面/晶界区域的预测质量显著差于体相"
msgstr ""
"Surface, interface, or grain-boundary predictions are much worse than bulk "
"predictions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:43
#: b4336fd5ab854d95bdbce1bd9cdf05f2
msgid "需要做区域选择性化学改性：表面钝化、界面掺杂、层状材料夹层替换"
msgstr ""
"Region-selective chemistry is needed for passivation, interface doping, or "
"layer replacement"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:44
#: d70846b6d95b4747bce9cdeb761f43a5
msgid "替换规则可以用 x/y/z 坐标表达式写清楚"
msgstr "The target region can be expressed with x, y, and z coordinates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:46
#: ad8ecb7393794d59b2cd5bb2850ad932
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:47
#: cb69643a1c294cfaa901bb3c317788ea
msgid "不需要空间选择性 → 用 `Random Doping` 更直接"
msgstr "No spatial selection is needed; use `Random Doping`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:48
#: e32004f847ce44a1846226a2a60b15d9
msgid "替换规则无法用 x/y/z 表达式描述（如按近邻配位筛选）"
msgstr "The rule depends on topology or coordination rather than coordinates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:49
#: d08cf5cb7204494ea379335c9c8c6bbc
msgid "只需要全局组合配比变化 → `Composition Sweep` + `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""
"Only global composition should change; use `Composition Sweep` with `Random "
"Occupancy`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:51
#: d41663ef475446ad881663f3219c430e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:53
#: 782aa23a6d694da8a0cc9b66aa3eaaf7
msgid "Target（target）"
msgstr "Target（target）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:55
#: 3c1bb0260c764edf906b741926eccba8
msgid "`str`，默认空。被替换的元素符号，如 `O`、`Si`。只替换匹配该元素且满足下面 `condition` 的那部分位点。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Element to replace, such as `O` or `Si`. A site "
"must match both this element and `condition`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:57
#: 8839d6a5bf9a43c494d9f8061c5c3633
msgid "Replacements（replacements）"
msgstr "Replacements（replacements）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:59
#: 1bdc19d8714c4b3a90d38014e67e50c0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。替换配方，支持逗号冒号 `F:0.7,N:0.3` 或 JSON dict `{\"F\":0.7,\"N\":0.3}` "
"两种写法。比例会被自动归一化，在命中区域内按比例随机分配替换元素。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Replacement recipe in comma-colon form such as "
"`F:0.7,N:0.3` or as JSON ` {\"F\":0.7,\"N\":0.3}`. Fractions are normalized "
"and replacement species are assigned within the selected region."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:61
#: 6bd2878a82744b3aaa977f503c659b07
msgid "Condition（condition）"
msgstr "Condition（condition）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:63
#: 1f7e56de28a04d3ab02b87cac51aee47
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。空间条件表达式，不填或填 `all` = 所有 target 原子都命中。支持变量 `x`/`y`/`z`（笛卡尔坐标，单位 "
"Å），比较运算符 `<`/`>`/`<=`/`>=`/`==`/`!=`，逻辑 `and`/`or`/`not`，以及四则运算。相等判断可写 `x=0`"
" 或 `x==0`，两者含义相同。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. A spatial condition expression. Leave it empty or "
"use `all` to match every target atom. Supported variables are `x`/`y`/`z` "
"(Cartesian coordinates in Å), comparison operators "
"`<`/`>`/`<=`/`>=`/`==`/`!=`, logical operators `and`/`or`/`not`, and "
"arithmetic operators. Equality may be written as `x=0` or `x==0`; the two "
"forms are equivalent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:65
#: 3c59efd448e242de918c83bebf0d8d50
msgid "典型例子："
msgstr "Examples:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:66
#: 41e8e8edb9284f6d9e4f345a9951876e
msgid "`z>=8 and z<=10`：替换 z 在 8-10 Å 范围内的 target 原子"
msgstr "`z>=8 and z<=10`: select target atoms between 8 and 10 Å along z"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:67
#: a1b93d5de1b144ba90fa6e04ee514d63
msgid "`x>5 or y<2`：替换特定 xy 象限内的原子"
msgstr "`x>5 or y<2`: select atoms in the specified xy regions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:68
#: 4cd2b401766248aaaca797581a95026e
msgid "`z<=4`：只替换底层"
msgstr "`z<=4`: select only the bottom layer"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:70
#: c379f95874ab45a291d0e57adeaebe7d
msgid "Mode（mode）"
msgstr "Mode（mode）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:72
#: c39ac610b0cc4467b392c3ee41ea88ee
msgid "`int`，默认 0。`0` = Random 模式（按比例概率随机采样），`1` = Exact 模式（尽量精确匹配比例计数）。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. `0` is Random mode, which samples according to "
"probabilities; `1` is Exact mode, which matches integer species counts as "
"closely as possible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:74
#: 78e1bb105dcc4fc2a38faad6f38a7df3
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr "Seed（seed）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:76
#: d9f22c7de4eb471bab9070cccb027626
msgid "`int`，默认 0。非 0 时固定随机路径，控制多元素替换的分配随机性。`0` 表示每次运行随机。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. A nonzero seed fixes the site-to-species assignment for "
"mixed replacements; zero requests a new random assignment on each run."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:78
#: 1df6920af16a4d4eaecb22b91bfbada6
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:80
#: 8b770091f2b7428c8a2754560b45c753
msgid "表面单元素钝化（表面 O→F，窄窗口）"
msgstr "Single-species surface passivation (O -> F in a narrow window)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:81
#: 490e0520284f46888a3f45f3632cddd1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ConditionalReplaceCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"  \"replacements\": \"F:1.0\",\n"
"  \"condition\": \"z>=8 and z<=10\",\n"
"  \"seed\": [101],\n"
"  \"mode\": 1\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ConditionalReplaceCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"  \"replacements\": \"F:1.0\",\n"
"  \"condition\": \"z>=8 and z<=10\",\n"
"  \"seed\": [101],\n"
"  \"mode\": 1\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:93
#: 5c3d07b8ea9547c2b7812d235a72dc48
msgid "表面多元素钝化（表面 O→F/N，宽窗口）"
msgstr "Mixed surface passivation (O -> F/N in a wider window)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:94
#: 299167622f704e9bafa38256d527bafc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ConditionalReplaceCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"  \"replacements\": \"F:0.7,N:0.3\",\n"
"  \"condition\": \"z>=6 and z<=14\",\n"
"  \"seed\": [101],\n"
"  \"mode\": 0\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ConditionalReplaceCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"  \"replacements\": \"F:0.7,N:0.3\",\n"
"  \"condition\": \"z>=6 and z<=14\",\n"
"  \"seed\": [101],\n"
"  \"mode\": 0\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:106
#: 861d32be2bb545348c8e5dbbc5d0a509
msgid "全区域多元素替换（所有 O→F/N/Cl，用于探索区）"
msgstr "Global mixed replacement (all O -> F/N/Cl for exploration)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:107
#: d2298831b1ee44978b2ecc112fbdcb54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ConditionalReplaceCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"  \"replacements\": \"F:0.4,N:0.3,Cl:0.3\",\n"
"  \"condition\": \"all\",\n"
"  \"seed\": [101],\n"
"  \"mode\": 0\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ConditionalReplaceCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"  \"replacements\": \"F:0.4,N:0.3,Cl:0.3\",\n"
"  \"condition\": \"all\",\n"
"  \"seed\": [101],\n"
"  \"mode\": 0\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:119
#: b10e61154ddc476195b423fc87e23b06
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:121
#: 9df9cfdd47aa4893882fa69e4eb18e52
msgid "`Group Label` → `Conditional Replace`：先打 group 标签分割区域，再用坐标条件做精细筛选。"
msgstr ""
"`Group Label` -> `Conditional Replace`: identify broad regions, then refine "
"selection with coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:122
#: b946c630ffce429ea8765bb5b4a66876
msgid "`Conditional Replace` → `Atomic Perturb`：替换后加坐标噪声，松驰替换引入的局部应力。"
msgstr ""
"`Conditional Replace` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add local coordinate diversity "
"after substitution. DFT relaxation is still required for physical labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:123
#: 04d21c96e1ce41f88439595126c099f7
msgid "`Conditional Replace` → `Random Doping`：先做区域选择性替换覆盖表面化学，再做全局替位补样。"
msgstr ""
"`Conditional Replace` -> `Random Doping`: cover region-specific surface "
"chemistry before global substitution diversity."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:125
#: e1c4c6511c5743368ae3bb40b9bcc194
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:127
#: b551eb9d70e4480b862904f11f84141c
msgid ""
"**输出 = 输入，没有替换。** `target` 为空，或输入结构中不存在该元素，或 `condition` 把所有候选位点都过滤掉了。先用 "
"`condition=all` 验证替换逻辑，再逐步收紧条件。"
msgstr ""
"**Output equals input.** `target` is empty or absent, or `condition` rejects"
" every candidate. Test with `condition=all`, then narrow the expression "
"incrementally."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:129
#: 9e05080fd530408bb38bffeff1cf8752
msgid ""
"**替换了不该替换的位点。** condition 表达式区域范围写错了。检查结构坐标范围，确认上下限对应目标区域。Slab 的真空层可能导致 z "
"坐标超出预期。"
msgstr ""
"**Unexpected sites were replaced.** Inspect the structure's coordinate range"
" and correct the condition bounds. Vacuum in a slab can make z limits "
"unintuitive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:131
#: e2ad8269e31548ac8da2a51534ee9f12
msgid ""
"**condition 解析失败。** 检查变量是否只用了 x/y/z，并确认没有 "
"`===`、函数调用等不支持的语法。`=`、`==`、`>=`、`<=`、`!=` 都是合法写法；非法表达式会明确抛出 `ValueError`。"
msgstr ""
"**The condition could not be parsed.** Check that it uses only x/y/z "
"variables and does not contain unsupported syntax such as `===` or function "
"calls. `=`, `==`, `>=`, `<=`, and `!=` are all valid. An invalid expression "
"raises `ValueError` explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:133
#: dd68e553bd6d47d28dbd625c2f9b8942
msgid "**替换后键长不合理。** 纯化学替换不做结构弛豫。如果键长明显异常，建议后接弛豫计算。"
msgstr ""
"**Bond lengths are unreasonable after replacement.** This operation changes "
"species without relaxation. Relax the structure before treating it as a "
"physical configuration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:135
#: 226abac4acc04f5a9f8f1f9b8e236519
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:137
#: 41b25382a33c42fd9d069421c057b2a2
msgid "`Repl(O->F)` / `Repl(O->F,N,Cl)` 格式。仅在确实发生了替换时才写入标签。"
msgstr ""
"Formats: `Repl(O->F)` and `Repl(O->F,N,Cl)`. A label is added only when a "
"replacement occurs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:139
#: 2d771a3f19a74c99a27a5550824846b8
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:141
#: abb3e1d0b9664f019faa130d1564a51f
msgid "固定非零 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。多元素替换模式下 seed 控制哪个位点分配到哪个替换元素。`seed=0` 表示每次运行随机。"
msgstr ""
"A fixed nonzero `seed` reproduces an input. For mixed replacements it "
"controls which site receives each species; `seed=0` generates a new "
"assignment each run."

#~ msgid "**condition 解析失败。** 检查语法：变量只能用 x/y/z，运算符拼写正确（`and` 非 `AND`，`==` 非 `=`）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The condition does not parse.** Variables"
#~ " are limited to x, y, and z; "
#~ "use lowercase `and` and comparison `==`,"
#~ " not assignment `=`."
